References and credits
----------------------

Advocatra MCP is an independent implementation. It contains no code copied
from any other project. It consumes `packages/case`, `packages/billing`,
`packages/crypto` and `packages/vault` from
https://github.com/johnarleyburns/advocatra (same author) as a git
submodule under `vendor/advocatra`, since those packages are not yet
published to a package registry.

Dependencies bundled with Advocatra MCP must be MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, ISC,
0BSD or CC0; CI enforces this.
